{"name":"Northern Mariana Islands","slug":"northern-mariana-islands","code":"MP","continent":"Oceania","hero":"plonkit/northern-mariana-islands/nmi_banner.webp","updated":"2023-10-15T00:00:00.000Z","sections":[{"title":"Identifying Northern Mariana Islands","title_zh":"辨識北馬里亞納群島","items":[{"id":"4Uer","text":["The Northern Mariana Islands is a United States overseas territory. As such, it is counted as **the US** for country streaks purposes."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/northern-mariana-islands/nmi_location.webp","link":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/Northern_Mariana_Islands_in_Oceania_%28-mini_map_-rivers%29.svg/2388px-Northern_Mariana_Islands_in_Oceania_%28-mini_map_-rivers%29.svg.png","clues":[],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"QEJK","text":["The entire Google car is blurred, however an antenna at the front right can be seen. The antenna is also **noticeably closer** to the camera than in the Guam Google car."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/northern-mariana-islands/nmi_car.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/e1TVSUpRgtRetpM26","clues":["google_vehicles"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"H2l8","text":["Northern Mariana Islands have **wooden poles**, frequently with a crossbar at the top.","NOTE: Guam typically has concrete poles."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/northern-mariana-islands/nmi_pole.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/WcWY9Maj3jL19JjD9","clues":["utility_poles"],"important":false,"tagged":true},{"id":"jle0","text":["The Northern Mariana Islands uses **blue** street signs, unlike Guam, which use green street signs."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/northern-mariana-islands/streetsign.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/3E6PHtcJLSiYhBBMA","clues":["signs"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"7SWm","text":["Northern Mariana Islands have a **tropical climate** with a lot of dense and somewhat low vegetation."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/northern-mariana-islands/nmi_landscape.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/iqpm75XrCW6PDLw9A","clues":["nature"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"c1Di","text":["Royal Poinciana, Flamboyant Tree or Flame Tree ([Delonix Regia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Delonix_regia)) is the official tree of the Northern Mariana Islands and very common to see in the territory. Its **wide crown** with **bright red flowers** is easy to recognize.","NOTE: This tree is not common in Guam."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/northern-mariana-islands/nmi_redflower.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/tnw3drhwSREqtCtc6","clues":["nature"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"2NSb","text":["Both Northern Mariana Islands and Guam often have a very **large number **of** road reflectors**."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/northern-mariana-islands/nmi_reflectorspam.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/UWyusyAu8qRihpKg9","clues":[],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"lSGS","text":["**East Asian languages** such as Japanese, Chinese, Korean, and even Russian are common to see in the Northern Mariana Islands.","NOTE: This is also the case in Guam."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/northern-mariana-islands/nmi_asian.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/Mv91ffZwXQdu9UBe6","clues":["language"],"important":false,"tagged":false}]},{"title":"Regional clues","title_zh":"區域性線索","items":[{"id":"H5Sf","text":["The only island with car coverage is the main island of **Saipan**. The islands north of that have no coverage. Tinian and Sinapalu south of Saipan only have **tripod** coverage."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/northern-mariana-islands/nmi_coveragemap.webp","link":"","clues":[],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"sU1n","text":["**Dense commercial areas** can be found on the southern half of the west coast."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/northern-mariana-islands/nmi_towncentres.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/3ismHgYegwwX6C6a8","clues":[],"important":false,"tagged":false}]},{"title":"Spotlight","title_zh":"重點地標","items":[{"id":"MPiv","text":["The **Suicide Cliff** is a steep cliff with a lot of exposed rock near the northern tip of the island."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/northern-mariana-islands/nmi_suicidecliff.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/abcbroprRxLYZe9y8","clues":[],"important":false,"tagged":false}]}],"tip_count":11,"facts":{"driving_side":"right","phone_numbers":"+1 (670)","domains":[".mp"],"currencies":[{"name":"United States dollar","symbol":"$ or US$ or U$","status":"official","code":"USD"}],"years":[],"lines":[["white"],["yellow"],["white"]]},"gallery":{"companies":[{"image":"geohints/companies/companies_19.svg","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/Q95PGKccUGiwXELK7"}],"flags":[{"image":"geohints/flags/flags_82.svg","link":""}],"google_vehicles":[{"image":"geohints/googleVehicles/car_201.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/h7D5SsmbN5ntCQvG7"}],"license_plates":[{"image":"geohints/licensePlates/Northern_Mariana_Islands.webp","link":""}],"scenery":[{"image":"geohints/sceneries/northern_mariana_islands_1.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/nCVRxsRAzEn8pFGd9"},{"image":"geohints/sceneries/northern_mariana_islands_2.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/NYjFDCtAHkREaK1N7"},{"image":"geohints/sceneries/northern_mariana_islands_3.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/bpwYNzRKdBxghXcQA"}],"traffic_lights":[{"image":"geohints/trafficLights/light_71.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/YLeXNSkKnsiNLyA96"}]},"key":"northern mariana islands"}